---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ava-pillars">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ava-pillars-header">
      <div class="eyebrow ctr">What AV Active Focuses On</div>
      <h2 class="st bl">The Five Pillars</h2>
      <p
        style="
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 12px;
            max-width: 520px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            line-height: 1.65;
          "
      >
        Every feature in AV Active is built around these five commitments to the veteran community.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="ava-pillars-grid">
      <div class="ava-pillar">
        <div class="ava-pillar-icon">💬</div>
        <div class="ava-pillar-title">Community</div>
        <p class="ava-pillar-body">
          Stay connected with fellow Alabama vets, share experiences, and build the kind of
          brotherhood and sisterhood that doesn't end at ETS.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ava-pillar">
        <div class="ava-pillar-icon">💪</div>
        <div class="ava-pillar-title">Health &amp; Fitness</div>
        <p class="ava-pillar-body">
          Track workouts, join challenges, and stay accountable with other vets who understand what
          it means to push past the hard days.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ava-pillar">
        <div class="ava-pillar-icon">🧠</div>
        <div class="ava-pillar-title">Well-Being</div>
        <p class="ava-pillar-body">
          Access mental wellness resources, PTG programming, and tools that support the whole person
          — not just the physical side of recovery.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ava-pillar">
        <div class="ava-pillar-icon">🌱</div>
        <div class="ava-pillar-title">PTG &amp; Growth</div>
        <p class="ava-pillar-body">
          Post-Traumatic Growth is at the heart of everything Alabama Veteran does. AV Active brings
          that framework into your daily life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ava-pillar">
        <div class="ava-pillar-icon">📅</div>
        <div class="ava-pillar-title">Events &amp; Challenges</div>
        <p class="ava-pillar-body">
          From group rucks to War on the Greens, AV Active keeps you plugged into events and monthly
          challenges built for Alabama veterans.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
